---
import { EMAIL } from '../lib/site';
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-label">About</div>

  <div class="about-body">
    <p>
      I'm a front-end web designer and developer. I spend most of my time in Figma, exploring editorial aesthetics, typography, and grid systems, but I'm just as at home in the code that ships it — Astro, React, or Vue, with the occasional backend rabbit hole just to see how the data connects.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I'm not doing client work, I'm usually setting random design challenges for
      myself, poking around AI tools, or leaving half-baked UI concepts in my notes.
    </p>
    <p>
      My path here wasn't a straight line. I spent a decade in customer experience for major
      publications like <span class="highlight">Tribune Publishing</span> and the <span class="highlight">Los Angeles Times</span>. Eventually, I made the
      pivot—doing front-end at <span class="highlight">MC2</span>, then visual design for AI training models at <span class="highlight">Wirestock</span>.
      It's a different world now, but the instinct is exactly the same: caring about how
      things look, feel, and work for real people.
    </p>
    <p class="about-cta">
        I make things nobody asked for. Ask me for something <a class="email" href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>